{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12793","headline":"别泛水县尉 · 韩翃","name":"别泛水县尉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"未央宫殿金开钥，诏引贤良卷珠箔。\n花间赐食近丹墀，烟里挥毫对青阁。\n万年枝影转斜光，三道先成君激昂。\n谷水直言身不顾，郄诜高第转名香。\n绿槐阴阴出关道，上有蝉声下秋草。\n奴子平头骏马肥，少年白皙登王畿。\n五侯客舍偏留宿，一县人家争看归。\n南向千峯北临水，佳期赏地应穷此。\n赋诗或送郑行人，举酒常陪魏公子。\n自怜寂寞会君稀，犹着前时博士衣。\n我欲低眉问知己，若将无用废东归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩翃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12793.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12793","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}